<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila says to lower overnight rate to 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Manila says to lower overnight rate to 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank said on Wednesday it would lower its overnight borrowing rate to 28 percent from 32.</p>
</text>
